# procedural-chart
# Admission gate for a benchmark question set: no question enters the benchmark unless it can detect the errors it claims to test (#120).
direction: right
proposed: question set, claims and schema written
fetched: the five NEMOSIS parquet tables present
admitted: every claim true, every question agreed, discriminating and unflippable, scorer proven

proposed -> fetched: "cmd: just nemosis-fetch DISPATCHLOAD \"2025/09/01 00:00:00\" \"2025/09/02 00:00:00\" | pass: prints 'nemosis-fetch: DISPATCHLOAD rows=<N> sha256=<prefix>' (repeat for DISPATCHPRICE, DISPATCHREGIONSUM, DUDETAILSUMMARY, DISPATCHINTERCONNECTORRES)"
fetched -> admitted: "cmd: just nem-question-lint | pass: prints 'PASS nem-question-lint: 0 failure(s)' and no line starting FAIL"
